IDD_FOLDER_DIALOG DIALOGEX 0, 0, 245, 161
STYLE DS_SETFONT | DS_FIXEDSYS | DS_CENTER | WS_POPUP | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU | WS_THICKFRAME
